<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><%- include('partials/head', { title: '50v50 Control - Wardogs Dash' }) %></head><body><%- include('partials/nav') %><main class="page team-control-page"><header class="dashboard-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Admin server controls</p><h1>50v50 enforcement</h1><p class="muted">Redirect players away from one selected faction while keeping the two permitted factions balanced.</p></div><span class="status-pill <%= enforcement.enabled ? '' : 'status-pill--muted' %>"><%= enforcement.enabled ? 'Enabled' : 'Disabled' %></span></header><% if (saved) { %><p class="save-confirm">Server mode and name updated.</p><% } %><% if (error) { %><p class="error-banner"><%= error %></p><% } %><% if (!status) { %><section class="dashboard-panel empty-panel"><h2>Live server unavailable</h2><p class="muted">Connect RCON to view or change 50v50 enforcement.</p></section><% } else { %><section class="team-control-metrics"><article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-card__label">Live server name</span><strong class="team-server-name"><%= status.serverName %></strong><span class="metric-card__detail"><%= status.players.current %> / <%= status.players.max %> players · <%= status.map %></span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="metric-card__label">Current experience</span><strong class="team-server-name"><%= (status.experiences || []).join(', ') || 'Unknown' %></strong><span class="metric-card__detail"><%= (status.factionScores || []).length %> active factions</span></article></section><section class="dashboard-panel team-control-panel"><form method="POST" action="/team-control/configure"><div class="team-toggle-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">Enforcement switch</p><h2>Run 50v50 redirection</h2><p class="muted">Players on the blocked faction are checked every five seconds and moved to the less-populated permitted faction.</p></div><label class="team-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%= enforcement.enabled ? 'checked' : '' %> /><span></span><b>Enable</b></label></div><div class="team-name-preview"><div><span>Off</span><strong><%= standardServerName %></strong></div><div><span>On</span><strong><%= enforcedServerName %></strong></div></div><div class="team-faction-grid"><label>Allowed faction one<select class="role-select" name="allowedFactionOne"><option value="">Choose faction</option><% (status.factionScores || []).forEach((faction) => { %><option value="<%= faction.name %>" <%= enforcement.allowedFactionOne === faction.name ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= faction.name %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Allowed faction two<select class="role-select" name="allowedFactionTwo"><option value="">Choose faction</option><% (status.factionScores || []).forEach((faction) => { %><option value="<%= faction.name %>" <%= enforcement.allowedFactionTwo === faction.name ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= faction.name %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Blocked faction<select class="role-select" name="blockedFaction"><option value="">Choose faction</option><% (status.factionScores || []).forEach((faction) => { %><option value="<%= faction.name %>" <%= enforcement.blockedFaction === faction.name ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= faction.name %></option><% }) %></select></label></div><p class="fine-print">The server name is changed immediately when you apply this switch. The configured RCON player-move endpoint is <%= capabilities?.routes?.includes('PATCH /v1/players/{id}') ? 'available' : 'not available' %>.</p><button class="action-button action-button--primary" type="submit">Apply server mode</button></form></section><section class="dashboard-panel team-faction-status"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Live distribution</p><h2>Current factions</h2></div></div><div class="team-faction-list"><% (status.factionScores || []).forEach((faction) => { %><div><i style="background: <%= faction.colorHex %>"></i><span><%= faction.name %></span><strong><%= factionCounts[faction.name] || 0 %> players</strong></div><% }) %></div></section><% } %></main></body></html>
